This registry includes:

1. Entities - Core system objects like Case, Suspect, Property, Audit Trail, etc.
2. Actors - All user roles that interact with the system including Police Officers, Admins, Citizens, etc.
3. Functions - Key system operations like RegisterCase, InvestigateCase, SearchCase, etc.

Each entry includes:
- Standardized IDs following the specified naming conventions
- Canonical names in PascalCase
- Display names in Chinese
- All documented aliases for each concept

The registry consolidates all variations of the same concept (like different terms for "Police Officer") into single entries while preserving all the original terms as aliases.

The extraction covers all major sections of the document including:
- Core modules (Registration, Investigation, Prosecution, etc.)
- Non-functional requirements (Audit, Access Control, Usability, etc.)
- System architecture recommendations
- Performance and scalability requirements

